// v5.2 (28 Jul 2026): PANEL SELF-CONTRADICTION FIXES (Jay, CUMMINSIND 125m).
//   The panel gave TWO entry instructions ~4% apart, and targeted the level it told
//   you not to target. Both are text/label bugs — no gate, score or plan MATH changed.
//   1. CLEAR-TO-BREAK said "Arm a buy-STOP above <ovh>" (v4.7 APOLLOHOSP wording,
//      which assumed buy-stop) while the Plan row and STATUS follow entry_method,
//      defaulted to RETEST since the 23-Jul entry A/B. That line now follows the same
