// v5.1 (28 Jul 2026): v5.0 REVIEW FIXES. v5.0 never compiled (token limit) and three of
// its five advertised features were declared but not wired. This revision makes the file
// do what the changelog says, and reverts one change that broke Pine<->Python parity.
//   • REVERTED the 5-bar "sticky" PA window. It claimed to match pa_patterns.py, but that
//     module evaluates the LAST BAR ONLY — the window CREATED drift (Sigma-PA summed
//     patterns that fired on different bars) and let the panel print GO while the V/L/B
//     gate chips read fail beneath it. Every _v read is a plain [_so] shift again.
//   • CONFLUENCE now actually wired: cf_w_wcl was counted in cf_max but never added to
//     cf, so the ceiling rose while the score could not — every name understated and
//     *strong harder to reach than v4.7. Full weight at Context >= 4, half on Wyckoff
//     ACCUMULATION alone.
//   • LOCATION now actually wired (the point of the integration): near_vp_val/near_vp_poc
//     were computed and referenced nowhere. Volume-Profile VAL/POC now join support_pass
//     behind the new `en_wcl_loc` switch, and are NAMED in the Support Zone panel row.
//     This LOOSENS the GO gate — expect more GOs. Isolate a regression by toggling it.
//   • VOLUME PROFILE now runs on the last bar only, not every confirmed bar. It is a
//     100 x 40 nested loop; per-bar execution would trip TradingView's time limit.
//   • STAGE SCORE fail-safe: nz(d_bel30, 0.0) handed back the MAXIMUM bullish score on
//     missing daily data. Now nz(..., 1.0), matching s2_proxy.
//   • TOKEN BUDGET: removed dead f_pa_5(); collapsed the four Wyckoff bearish tiers to
//     two branches (all labels preserved, PSY -1 -> -2); the Setup Detector tests the
//     numeric wyk_score_base / smc flags instead of re-parsing display strings.
//   • DROPPED, NOT PENDING (28-Jul, Jay's call — do not read the v5.0 header as fact,
//     and do not "finish" these later without re-reading the reasons):
//       - Structure-Health GO downgrade. MEASURED over 38 board names on daily + 75m
//         at bos_len 5/7/10: choch_count_20 NEVER reached 3 (0/38 in every cell; the
//         distribution tops out at 2). A veto keyed on >= 3 would never fire, and a
//         veto that cannot fire is worse than none — you would believe you were
//         protected. bos_len 10 -> 5 was tested and rejected too: it moves non-CLEAN
//         from 11% to 13% on 75m and nothing on daily, while changing SMC trend/score
//         for every name. Only the Kelly -0.25 remains. Structure Health stays a
//         DISPLAY row until someone measures whether CHoCH count predicts worse trades.
//         NOTE the "BROKEN" tier is therefore UNREACHABLE and will never render.
//       - SMC Bull-OB location source. Redundant: WCL's OB is a 5-bar construct, while
//         zone_engine / the S4 zone subsystem already carry leg-base-leg zones with
//         base-quality scoring, FVG tagging, per-TF width bands and the full
//         tested/violated lifecycle. A weaker second definition of the same concept is
//         how gates start disagreeing with themselves.
//       - PA* liquidity-sweep escalation. Cosmetic: it only relabels GO as GO *strong.
//         It does not gate, size or stop, and per the 23-Jul backtest the GO gate is a
//         trade CLASSIFIER, not an entry optimizer.
